# self-evolve memory pools (repo-root mem/), tiered by how long they live:
#   history_pool/ + .processed_history = SHORT-term, local runtime state -> ignored;
#   func_candidate_pool/              = MID-term memory -> TRACKED, so candidates
#       travel via git to the large-scale eval cluster (Benchmark Evaluator
#       accumulates stats.json there). Long-term library = capx/ code via PR.
/mem/*
!/mem/func_candidate_pool/
logscapx/third_party/anygrasp_sdk/
